# L §3.2: "day is a dimension of its own, so 1 day / 1 year is refused (LOAD-UNIT)".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "a source"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
unit hour "godzina"

input annual: money PLN

ask q1: annual * (1 day / 1 year)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
